<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></span><div style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">I hope you are doing well.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);"><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">If you&nbsp;want to add a property to your Memphis Invest portfolio&nbsp;but do not have the funds</font></div><div style=""><font size="2" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" face="Arial, sans-serif">necessary to fund your next deal, this email is meant specifically for you.<br></font><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">I wanted to let you know that there is a possibility for you to add at least 1 property to&nbsp;</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">your portfolio with Memphis Invest&nbsp;<u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">with little or no money out of pocke</u>t using your self-directed IRA&nbsp;or your solo-401k.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Since you previously purchased at least one property through Memphis Invest using your IRA/solo-k outright&nbsp;</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">without financing, I want to show you how you can borrow against the equity in the property you already own&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">to purchase a 2nd property</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;with very little (or possibly, nothing) out of pocket.</span></font></div><div style=""><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Bridge Capital is now offering&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><u>non-recourse financing on 20 year, fixed rate at 8.4% with 50% down terms</u></span>, which are by far&nbsp;the best non-recourse terms we have ever been able to obtain through our financing partners.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Many of you receiving this email will immediately see how favorable those terms really are, as you might have loans&nbsp;outstanding between 10-12% through our past non-recourse financing options.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);"><u><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></u></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Please take a look at the attachment to this email.</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;I've put together a very simple powerpoint that explains the process </span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">of cross-collateralization and I have provided a real example of how I just finished helping one of my clients acquire their 2nd&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">property with almost nothing out of pocket.</span></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">If this is something that you are interested in talking about,&nbsp;<font color="#1155cc"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR ">please schedule a call with me this week</a></font>&nbsp;and we can discuss&nbsp;your options.</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Please let me know how I can help you build your portfolio!</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">------</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;"><span style="border-collapse: separate;"><table border="0" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 153);"><tbody><tr><td width="200px" style="margin: 0px;"><font size="2"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Ashley Tinker</span><br></font><blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"></blockquote><font size="2"><font color="#000000" style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">Portfolio Advisor</font><font color="#741b47" style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</font></font><br><b><font color="#666666">Tel:&nbsp;<a value="+19017517191" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">901.505.0724</a></font></b><br><b><font color="#666666">Fax:&nbsp;<a value="+19017517187" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">901.751.7187</a></font></b><br><blockquote style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"></blockquote><b style="font-size: large;"><font size="2" color="#990000"><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">www.MemphisInvest.com</a></font></b><br><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><a href="mailto:ashleybush@memphisinvest.com" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">ashley.tinker@memphisinvest.com</a></b><div style="font-size: large; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: small; text-align: start;"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: large; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: small; text-align: start;">&nbsp;</span><img src="https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/P-ZUATG-9KvjtTCYPKyMYZvbZ1icP24mB3AQG8FiodVo-sdJ2JgTowsNbAbkh7l2lFLFbGwo2IeCTAWCabhVQv1K4a8rul-WiunKnoxlWZI0uzWqL8S3lDRln2IqOfbrtqKAikZg-5guzwjsB7ufNvHZ26--Z-xThtVQ2w=s0-d-e1-ft#http://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hub/44341/file-2286025665-png/Memphis-Invest-Logo-email-footer.png" style="font-size: small; text-align: start;"><br></div><div style="font-size: large; text-align: center;"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; text-align: start;"><div style="font-size: small; color: rgb(0, 0, 153);"><br></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><span style="text-al